# │   ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓   │
# │   ┃                                                                  ┃   │
# │   ┃ Uses original icons as well as icons from the following themes:  ┃   │
# │   ┃                                                                  ┃   │
# │   ┃         ipodVOL by xameius, submitted by Stephen Carroll         ┃   │
# │   ┃   (Battery Status, Hold Indicator, Player Status, Repeat Mode,   ┃   │
# │   ┃                     modified Speaker Icons)                      ┃   │
# │   ┃                                                                  ┃   │
# │   ┃          ChicagoUnified by Brendan Riera (Shuffle Icon)          ┃   │
# │   ┃                                                                  ┃   │
# │   ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛   │
# │                                                                          │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# 	Load needed fonts
#
%Fl(3,16-ChicagoCJK12.fnt)
%Fl(4,10-Pixo7B.fnt)
#
# 	Preload icons
%xl(B,batteryStatus.bmp,3,2,6)
%xl(C,batteryChargingStatus.bmp,3,2,5)
%xl(P,playerStatus.bmp,0,2,4)
%xl(H,holdSlider.bmp,0,2)
%xl(U,timer.bmp,1,2)
%xl(L,speaker.bmp,2,3,9)
# USB icon from sprocket1Pod by Le Khanh Binh (CC-BY-SA 3.0)
%xl(X,prohibited.bmp,0,0)
#
#
#
# ---------
# Logic:
# ---------
# 	Set up UI Viewport 
#
%?if(%cs, =, 21)<%VI(usb)%Vd(usb)|%VI(main)>
#
# 	Show speaker icon on QuickScreen while changing volume
#
%?and(%if(%cs, =, 10),%if(%mv(2), =, v))<%Vd(volIcon)|%Vd(playerStatus)>
#
#
# 	Display battery icon that corresponds to the currently remaining charge,
# 	or show battery level in %, depending on system setting
%?if(%St(battery display), =, numeric)<%Vd(battLevel)|%Vd(battIcon)>
#
#
# 	Show Storage Activity Indicator on screens other than the WPS
%?and(%if(%lh, =, h),%if(%cs, !=, 2))<%Vd(diskon)>
#
#
# 	Display the current time on every screen.
%Vd(currTime)
#
#
# ---------
# Viewports:
# ---------
#
%Vl(diskon,-25,0,21,1,-)
%dr(0,0,-,-,1)
#
# 	Battery level
# 	treat 99% as fully charged already
#
%Vl(battLevel,-30,4,3,12,4)%Vf(0)%Vb(3)
# whitespace character
 
%Vl(battLevel,-27,4,25,12,4)%Vf(0)%Vb(3)
%?or(%if(%bl, =, 100),%if(%bl, =, 99))<%acCGD|%ac%bl%%>
#
#
#	separator bar on top
%V(0,18,-,1,-)
%dr(0,0,-,-,0)
#
#
# 	main content view
%Vi(main,0,20,160,108,-)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)

# Empty UI viewport while the USB screen is active. This suppresses
# Rockbox's default USB logo so the themed USB view is shown instead.
%Vi(usb,0,0,0,0,-)
#
#
#
%Vl(volIcon,4,0,20,15,-)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
%?pv<%xd(La)|%xd(Lb)|%xd(Lc)|%xd(Ld)|%xd(Le)|%xd(Lf)|%xd(Lg)|%xd(Lh)|%xd(Lh)|%xd(Lh)|%xd(Li)>
#
#
# 	Battery Icon
# 	First entry in %bl is used when the battery level isn’t known,
# 	then goes from 0 to n for battery level == 100
#
%Vl(battIcon,-30,2,28,12,-)
%?bp<%?bl<%xd(Ca)|%xd(Ca)|%xd(Ca)|%xd(Cb)|%xd(Cb)|%xd(Cb)|%xd(Cb)|%xd(Cc)|%xd(Cc)|%xd(Cc)|%xd(Cc)|%xd(Cc)|%xd(Cc)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Cd)|%xd(Ce)|%xd(Ce)>|%?bl<%xd(Bb)|%xd(Bb)|%xd(Bb)|%xd(Bc)|%xd(Bc)|%xd(Bc)|%xd(Bc)|%xd(Bd)|%xd(Bd)|%xd(Bd)|%xd(Bd)|%xd(Bd)|%xd(Bd)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Be)|%xd(Bf)|%xd(Bf)>>
#
#
#
# 	Player Status Icon
%Vl(playerStatus,4,2,20,12,-)
%?mp<|%xd(Pa)|%xd(Pb)|>
#
#
#
#
# 	Hold Slider Icon
%V(24,1,11,13,-)
%?mh<%xd(H)>
#
#
# 	Sleep Timer Icon
%Vl(timerIcon,24,2,11,12,-)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
%xd(U)
# 
#
#
#
%Vl(longTitle,31,1,-31,16,3)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
%s%ac%?cs<iPod|%Sx(Now Playing)|%Sx(Recording)|%Sx(FM Radio)|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%?cc<%?cf<%cH:%cM|%cl:%cM %cP>>%?if(%St(battery display), =, graphic)<%?cc<  >%?if(%bl, =, 100)<CGD|%?if(%bl, =, 99)<CGD|%bl%%>>>|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%?if(%Lt, =,Context Menu)<Perform Action...|%Lt>|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|iPod>
#
#	Shorter title bar text
%Vl(shortTitle,37,1,-37,16,3)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
%s%ac%?cs<iPod|%Sx(Now Playing)|%Sx(Recording)|%Sx(FM Radio)|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%?cc<%?cf<%cH:%cM|%cl:%cM %cP>>%?if(%St(battery display), =, graphic)<%?cc<  >%?if(%bl, =, 100)<CGD|%?if(%bl, =, 99)<CGD|%bl%%>>>|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%?if(%Lt, =,Context Menu)<Perform Action...|%Lt>|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|%Lt|iPod>
#
#
#	Current time
%Vl(currTime,35,1,-35,16,3)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
%ac%?cf<%cH:%cM|%cl:%cM %cP>
#
#
# 	Sleep Timer, erase surrounding area
%Vl(timerTextSurrounding,35,1,15,16,3)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
#
#
# 	Sleep Timer remaining time
%Vl(timerText,50,1,60,16,3)
%Vf(3)
%Vb(0)
%ac%bs
#
# 	Sleep Timer, erase surrounding area
%Vl(timerTextSurrounding,110,1,-30,16,3)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
#
# USB screen (screen state 21), adapted for 160x128.
%Vl(usb,55,35,50,50,-)
%xd(X)
%Vl(usb,0,103,160,20,4)
%Vf(0)
%Vb(3)
%acDo not disconnect.
#
#
